  "body": "If we log a warning whenever https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-method-normalize is invoked, perhaps that'll teach folks that HTTP method names are case-sensitive.\n\n@wanderview @tyoshino any interest in adding such a warning? You probably only want to do it once per global or some such, to avoid spamming too much.\n",
